{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"可缩类型 (同伦类型论)"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"可缩(同伦类型论)"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦类型论","text":"同伦类型论"}},{"Plain":"中, 称类型 $A$ 可缩, 是指 $A$ 有元素 $a: A$ 使得 $A$ 的任意元素都等于 $a$, 即\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{isContr}(A) := \\sum_{a : A}\\prod_{x : A} x =_A a.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}